    "text": "U.S. News Actions Facebook Tweet Email Tax Day 2026 deals: Where to find freebies and discounts on April 15 Prev Next Photo by: Debby Lowe/Shutterstock.com By: Scripps News Group Posted 3:26 PM, Apr 14, 2026 April 15 is Tax Day. It can bring plenty of stress, but some businesses are offering discounts and freebies to help ease the anxiety. Krispy KremeBuy a dozen doughnuts and get an Original Glazed dozen free with promo code TAXBREAK for online or in-app orders.Wendy’sGet a free 6-piece nuggets with a $5 purchase through the Wendy’s app.PopeyesTake 25% off a 3-piece tenders combo.QDOBA Rewards members who complete a short survey can unlock a $5 reward toward any full-sized entrée.IN CASE YOU MISSED IT | From dirty Dr. Pepper to dragon berry: McDonald’s expands drink menuPizza Hut Large three-topping pizzas are available for $10 when ordered online or through the app.7-ElevenUse code WRITEOFF to get $10.40 off any delivery order of $25 or more. HootersDine-in deal includes a $4.15 burger, $2.50 American draft beers and free kids meals. Menu Quality V323954724 Quality 360p 720p HD 1080p HD Auto(360p) 00:0002:00 1/100:18Scripps News MRSS Skip Ad Close Player Continue watchingTransportation Secretary Sean Duffy touts $12.5B upgrade for outdated air traffic control techafter the adVisit Advertiser websiteGO TO PAGEClose Player The video player is currently playing an ad.PotbellyGet a free Original sandwich with the purchase of an Original or Big sandwich using promo code BOGO online or in-app.TurboTaxClaim a $25 credit towards an Uber ride to a TurboTax appointment.PetcoPups can get a free snack from the treat bar. Most Recent UK passes bill to ban cigarette sales to those born after 2008 AP via Scripps News Group 41 minutes ago DHS says money to pay workers almost gone; TSA worker walkouts could return Scripps News Group 53 minutes ago Navy veteran charged in series of Atlanta-area attacks dies in jail AP via Scripps News Group 59 minutes ago Marketplace S